        "year": "2023",
        "ocr_text": "No. 391\n3/2/24\nINSTANT\nLOS ANGELES\nAKERS\nLEBRON JAMES\nWith a smooth left-handed layup in the second quarter against\nDenver, James became the first player in NBA history to reach\n40,000 career points. \"Man, you look at a lot of great players\nthat have played this game, and no one was even close to 40,\"\nsaid teammate Anthony Davis.\nРАМІИІ\nINSTANT\n1 of 11941\n2023-24 PANINI - INSTANT BASKETBALL\n#/E/E © 2024 Panini America, Inc. © 2024 NBA Properties, Inc. Produced in the USA.\n© 2024 the National Basketball Players Association. All rights reserved.",
