        "year": "2024",
        "ocr_text": "No. 54\nCONCOURSE\nPRIZM\nLOS ANGELES\nAKERS\nLAKERS\nLEBRON JAMES\nJames reached another milestone when\nthe Lakers played the Heat on Dec. 4, 2024.\nHis lone triple of the night came after\nhalftime and moved him into seventh place\non the league's all-time 3-point list (2,451),\nsurpassing Kyle Korver. It put him 110 makes\naway from passing the next non-active player\non the list, Reggie Miller (2,560)\nРАМІИІ\n2024-25 PANINI - SELECT BASKETBALL\nJEE © 2025 Panini America, Inc. © 2025 NBA Properties, Inc.\n© 2025 the National Basketball Players Association. All rights reserved.",
