        "year": "2024",
        "ocr_text": "No. 5\nPAMIMI\nLOS ANGELES\nLĄKERS\nLEBRON JAMES\nLOS ANGELES LAKERS\nJames has pretty much transcended\nthe basketball world. He is up there in\nouter space with the rest of the heavenly\ngreats of the game. If all his MVP awards\nwere stars, they would create quite a\nconstellation. If all his points were stars,\nthey would create the entire night sky.\nPRIZM\n2024-25 PANINI - PRIZM BASKETBALL\n/E/E © 2024 Panini America, Inc.\n© 2024 NBA Properties, Inc.\n© 2024 the National Basketball Players Association.\nAll rights reserved.",
